'''Holaria''' is a sovereign state in [[Western Meran]]. It borders [[Afarut]], [[Nykal]], [[Qym]] and [[Tamodia]] to the east, and [[Thyon]] to the south. 

==History==
*[[Sukats]] come from this area.
*TBD
*Holaria invades [[Tamodia]], starting the [[Boreal War]]. Eventually is pushed back and conquered by the [[Nagur Pact]] countries. Loses 13.1585% of its population during the war. 

